# CODEOWNERS
#
# Per-path review ownership for vero-core-contracts.
#
# There is no per-module maintainer subdivision yet, so every path
# defaults to the two current org maintainers (@N-thnI @N-i-xx)
# rather than leaving paths unassigned. The explicit entries below
# make ownership visible and easy to tighten per-module later.
#
# NOTE: this repo has no src/contracts/ directory — contract upgrade
# authority (upgrade_contract) lives in src/lib.rs, escrow payouts in
# src/vault.rs, and the global pause guard in src/circuit_breaker.rs.

# Global default: both org maintainers own everything.
* @N-thnI @N-i-xx

# ── Security-sensitive: upgrade authority & consensus ──────────────
